        "abstract": "The authors present a printed self-diplexing antenna structure suited for satellite communications for both Rx and Tx operations. Several beamforming networks are described and the main results on isolation, surface efficiency and axial ratio are presented. Also presented is an antenna structure working on both RHC and LHC.<<ETX xmlns:mml=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\">&gt;</ETX>",
